    "name": "hilltop_crypt_hamlet",
    "worldSeed": "10033856625708936625",
    "prompt": "A small hilltop hamlet with two distinct aboveground buildings: a round stone watchtower with a spiral interior stair, and a long timber-framed longhouse with a hearth and beds. They sit on gentle grassy ground. Carved into the solid rock directly beneath them are two distinct underground spaces: (1) a vaulted stone crypt with arched burial niches and cobweb detail, reached by a descending stone stair hidden under the longhouse floor; and (2) a partially flooded mine — rough tunnels with wooden support frames and rails leading to a small ore chamber studded with exposed ore, reached by a laddered vertical shaft beside the watchtower. A rough dug passage links the crypt to the mine. Keep the surface modest and believable; make the underground feel excavated out of real stone.",
